contractors acting on its behalf.

"Output" means any file or data produced by running the Software: sprites,
animations, sheets, map grounds, illustrations, sounds, music, fonts and the
like, together with their text sources. Outputs exclude the Software's source
code and compiled executables.

"Work" means a game, application, website, video, book or other creation of
Yours, made for Yourself or for a client, that uses Outputs.

